<title>USA: Minimed Inc Q2 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Minimed Inc Q2 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYLMAR, Calif. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended   Six Months Ended</p>
<p>			    6/27/97  6/28/96	 6/27/97  6/28/96</p>
<p> Net sales	  $17,044     $13,343     $32,309     $25,552</p>
<p> Cost of sales	5,711	 4,571	10,795	 8,883</p>
<p>    Gross profit   11,333	 8,772	21,514	16,669</p>
<p> Net income	   1,549	   932	 2,647	 1,559</p>
<p> Earnings per share  0.12	  0.08	  0.21	  0.13</p>
<p>Wgtd avg shrs 13,366,341  12,300,000  12,877,623  12,200,000</p>
<p>	 (In thousands, except share and per share amounts)</p>
